 {modal?.type==='ranking'&&<ModalFrame title="A thoughtful next step" subtitle="How your smart plan works" onClose={()=>setModal(null)}><div className="ranking-explanation"><div><span>01</span><h3>Start with what matters</h3><p>Resource priority (12 points per level), goal importance (4 per level), and your current focus (+12) shape the order.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Make space for momentum</h3><p>Courses you’ve started get +6. Deadlines within 30, 7, or 3 days get +6, +14, or +20. You can adjust all of these inputs.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Keep lessons in order</h3><p>The next unfinished lesson is eligible first. A second lesson from the same resource gets −30 points so your plan has a little variety. A course can focus on one module, while keeping lesson order inside that module.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>Fit your actual day</h3><p>Long lessons become study blocks that fit your remaining daily minutes. Log a block to resume where you left off. Pinning an eligible next lesson adds +1,000 points. If scores tie, a full lesson that fits wins over a partial block. Completed and archived resources leave the queue.</p></div></div><button className="primary full" onClick={()=>setModal(null)}>Sounds good <Check size={16}/></button></ModalFrame>}
